  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pakistan: Khyber Pakhtunkhwa (KP) and Federally Administered Tribal Areas (FATA) Emergency Recovery Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To support the Government of Pakistan, and specifically the Khyber Pakhtunkhwa (KP) province and Federally Administered Tribal Areas (FATA), in their recovery efforts through (a) providing safety net support grants to poor and vulnerable households affected by the militancy crisis in the target areas;  (b) providing conditional cash transfers (CCTs) for human development to poor and vulnerable households in the target areas; and (c) strengthening necessary capacities and systems for post-disaster safety nets.</narrative>
  </description>
